          "_name": "features03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features03\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n\t\t<header>Cards</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\"><input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f8f5f4\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#edefeb\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Our features</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-4 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTo add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i>· </i>Inspiration</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    Un regard extérieur pour débloquer une situation, clarifier vos idées ou imaginer de nouvelles pistes d’aménagement.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</b></p>\n                         <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Cette formule peut prendre la forme d’un rendez-vous conseil ou d’un diagnostic du lieu afin d’identifier les pistes d’amélioration et les orientations possibles.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    <i>· </i>Transformation\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPour repenser un lieu dans sa globalité, pour l'adapter à vos usages et révéler tout son potentiel.</b><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n              Cette mission comprend la conception du projet : organisation des espaces, choix esthétiques, plans et visualisations, avec un accompagnement dans la préparation des travaux, avec ou sans suivi de chantier.\n            </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2 mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    <i>· </i>Valorisation\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUn accompagnement complet pour transformer un lieu en expérience et révéler toute sa valeur.</b></p>\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Le studio vous accompagne dans la conception, la réalisation et la mise en valeur du projet (scénographie, shooting photo, identité graphique), avec une attention particulière portée au mobilier, et à l’atmosphère du lieu.\n            </p>\n                          <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Cette formule est particulièrement adaptée aux projets de lieux d’accueil ou de location.\n            </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "veIPByW49Q",
          "_anchor": "features03-5n",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".card-wrapper": {
              "background": "@wrapBgColor",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "2.25rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "4rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".card-title": {
              "color": "#3a352b"
            }
          },
          "_name": "header14",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header14\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Wrap</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"cardWidth\" title=\"Wrap Width\" min=\"6\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#f8f5f4\">\n\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f8f5f4\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"card col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{cardWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">En savoir plus sur les <i>prestations </i>et <i>tarifs</i>.</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tClick any text to edit or style it. Select text to insert a link. Click blue \"Gear\" icon in\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe top right corner to hide/show buttons, text, title and change the block background.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tClick red \"+\" in the bottom right corner to add a new block. Use the top left menu to create\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tnew pages, sites and add themes.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://lacazel.fr/contact\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">COMMENCER MON PROJET</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vcxTMj3bA9",
          "_anchor": "header14-3b",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".social-row": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "center",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              ".soc-item": {
                "margin": "8px",
                "a": {
                  "&:hover, &:focus": {
                    ".mbr-iconfont": {
                      "background-color": "@active"
                    }
                  },
                  ".mbr-iconfont": {
                    "width": "72px",
                    "height": "72px",
                    "display": "flex",
                    "align-items": "center",
                    "justify-content": "center",
                    "border-radius": "100%",
                    "font-size": "32px",
                    "background-color": "@iconBg",
                    "color": "@icon",
                    "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".row-links": {
              "width": "100%",
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".header-menu": {
              "list-style": "none",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              "padding": "0",
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "li": {
                "padding": "0 1rem 1rem 1rem",
                "p": {
                  "margin": "0"
                }
              }
            },
            ".copyright": {
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "color": "#f3e3d5",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            "header-menu-item": {
              "color": "#e0d0c1",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".title-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "transform-origin": "center",
              "margin-bottom": "20px",
              "width": "50%"
            },
            ".img-wrapper": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "margin": "0",
              "padding": "0"
            },
            ".img-wrapper img": {
              "align-items": "center",
              "max-width": "10%",
              "padding": "30px",
              "height": "auto",
              "display": "inline-block"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
              ".img-wrapper img": {
                "max-width": "30%",
                "padding": "15px"
              }
            },
            "P": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#e0d0c1"
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer3\" group=\"Footers\" global=\"\" once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n        <mbr-parameters>\n            <header>Size</header>\n            <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n            <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n            <header>Show/Hide</header>\n            <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Menu Items\" name=\"menuItems\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Copyright\" name=\"showCopy\" checked=\"\">\n            <header>Social</header>\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSoc\" checked=\"\">\n            <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Icons Amount\" name=\"soc\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"showSoc\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#5b511b\" name=\"icon\" condition=\"showSoc\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Active Color\" value=\"#f3e3d5\" condition=\"showSoc\" name=\"active\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#f3e3d5\" name=\"iconBg\" condition=\"showSoc\">\n            <header>Background</header>\n            <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax=\"\">\n                <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax=\"\">\n                <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#5b511b\" selected=\"\">\n            </fieldset>\n            <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked=\"\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n            <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n  \n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n                      <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n<a href=\"https://lacazel.fr\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/lacazel-studio-architecture-interieur-aveyron.webp\" alt=\"logo lacazel studio d'architecture d'intérieur aveyronnais\"></a>\n              </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"row-links\" mbr-if=\"menuItems > 0\">\n                <ul class=\"header-menu\" mbr-list=\"\" mbr-list-grow=\"menuItems\">\n                  <li mbr-text=\"\" class=\"header-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\"header-menu-item\"><a href=\"https://lacazel.fr/accompagnements\" class=\"text-info text-primary\">ACCOMPAGNEMENTS</a></li>\n                  <li mbr-text=\"\" class=\"header-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\"header-menu-item\"><a href=\"https://lacazel.fr/studio\" class=\"text-info text-primary\">STUDIO</a></li>\n                  <li mbr-text=\"\" class=\"header-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\"header-menu-item\"><a href=\"https://lacazel.fr/projets\" class=\"text-info text-primary\">PROJETS</a></li>\n                  <li mbr-text=\"\" class=\"header-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\"header-menu-item\"><a href=\"https://lacazel.fr/contact\" class=\"text-info text-primary\">CONTACT</a></li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n                        <div class=\"row-links\" mbr-if=\"menuItems > 0\">\n                <ul class=\"header-menu\" mbr-list=\"\" mbr-list-grow=\"menuItems\">\n                  <li mbr-text=\"\" class=\"header-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\"header-menu-item\"><a href=\"https://lacazel.fr/\" class=\"text-info text-primary\">Rodez</a></li>\n                  <li mbr-text=\"\" class=\"header-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\"header-menu-item\"><a href=\"https://lacazel.fr/\" class=\"text-info text-primary\">Espalion</a></li>\n                  <li mbr-text=\"\" class=\"header-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\"header-menu-item\"><a href=\"https://lacazel.fr/\" class=\"text-info\">Figeac</a></li>\n                  <li mbr-text=\"\" class=\"header-menu-item mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\"header-menu-item\"><a href=\"https://lacazel.fr/\" class=\"text-info text-primary\">Aurillac</a></li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showSoc\">\n                <div class=\"social-row\">\n                    <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 2\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lacazel.studio\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-instagram socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                                        <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 3\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/1PJD9tw67J\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-facebook socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 4\">\n                        <a href=\"https://fr.linkedin.com/in/emmanuelle-l%C3%A9pinay\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-linkedin socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-12 mt-4\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".copyright\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n        Lacazel Studio — 3670 route de Golinhac, 12140 Espeyrac\n    </p>\n</div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-if=\"showCopy\" mbr-class=\"{'mt-4': !showSoc, 'mt-5': showSoc}\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style copyright\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".copyright\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                    © Copyright Lacazel\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
