          "_name": "form02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"form5\" group=\"Forms\" plugins=\"formstyler, datepicker\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\">\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f8f5f4\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.4\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"(overlay && bg.type=='image')\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                        Contactez-moi</h3>\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                        Contacts Subtitle\n                    </h4>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div mbr-form class=\"col-lg-8 mx-auto mbr-form\">\n                <form action=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSevqwBWrb5DrbUx-MQkhPFzA0JqaCHW0RpT7zcCdZx9b7TdEg/formResponse\" name=\"Form Name\" method=\"POST\" class=\"mbr-form form-with-styler\" data-verified=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSevqwBWrb5DrbUx-MQkhPFzA0JqaCHW0RpT7zcCdZx9b7TdEg/formResponse\">\n                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div hidden=\"hidden\" data-form-alert class=\"alert alert-success col-12\">Merci d'avoir rempli le formulaire !\n\nNous vous remercions d'avoir pris le temps de me contacter. Votre demande est importante pour moi, et je vais l'examiner avec attention. Je vous répondrai dans les plus brefs délais.\n\nN'hésitez pas à me faire savoir si vous avez des questions en attendant.\n\nÀ bientôt !</div>\n                        <div hidden=\"hidden\" data-form-alert-danger class=\"alert alert-danger col-12\">\n                            Oops...! un problème est survenu !\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"dragArea row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-12 form-group mb-3\" data-for=\"name\">\n                            <input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.538554965\" placeholder=\"Nom*\" data-form-field=\"name\" class=\"form-control\" value required>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 form-group mb-3\" data-for=\"name\">\n                            <input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.107630633\" placeholder=\"Prénom*\" data-form-field=\"forname\" class=\"form-control\" value required>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 form-group mb-3\" data-for=\"email\">\n                            <input type=\"email\" name=\"entry.670545841\" placeholder=\"E-mail*\" data-form-field=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" value required>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 form-group mb-3\" data-for=\"phone\">\n                            <input type=\"tel\" name=\"entry.1390519902\" placeholder=\"Téléphone*\" data-form-field=\"phone\" class=\"form-control\" value required>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 form-group mb-3\" data-for=\"q\">\n                            <input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.XYZ\" placeholder=\"Combien de pieds possède généralement une chaise standard ?*\" data-form-field=\"answer\" class=\"form-control\" value required>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-mbrBtnAdd\" class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 align-center mbr-section-btn\"><a type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-secondary-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Envoyer</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
